{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43301","headline":"贡举人谒先师闻雅乐 · 吕炅","name":"贡举人谒先师闻雅乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"礼圣来羣彦，观光在此时。\n闻歌音乍远，合乐和还迟。\n调朗能谐竹，声微又契丝。\n轻泠流簨簴，缭绕动缨緌。\n九变将随节，三终必尽仪。\n国风由是正，王化自雍熙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕炅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}